<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Multi-Cluster on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/en/tags/multi-cluster/</link><description>Recent content in Multi-Cluster on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><managingEditor>蓝宝石的傻话</managingEditor><lastBuildDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 09:30:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/en/tags/multi-cluster/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>One UI for Multiple Clusters: What Open Source Offers</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/en/posts/incus/incus-multicluster-cross-cluster-migration/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 09:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/en/posts/incus/incus-multicluster-cross-cluster-migration/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The requirement grew: two independent clusters, one per subnet (each starting with a single leader, replicas to follow), one web frontend above both, plus one-click cross-cluster migration. This post separates &amp;ldquo;intra-cluster migration&amp;rdquo; from &amp;ldquo;cross-cluster migration&amp;rdquo; — they are not the same thing at all — and covers the five hard constraints of going cross-cluster, plus what the open-source survey concluded.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="pinning-the-topology-down"&gt;Pinning the topology down&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 960 560" font-family="-apple-system,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif" style="width:100%;max-width:960px;margin:1.5em auto;display:block;" role="img" aria-label="one frontend over two independent clusters in two subnets"&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="0" y="0" width="960" height="560" fill="#fafbfd"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="32" y="42" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;目标拓扑：一个前端，两个网段，两个独立主集群&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="32" y="64" font-size="12.5" fill="#7a86a8"&gt;L1 控制面 → L2 集群 → L3 成员 → L4 实例 · 两个集群之间没有任何共享数据库&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;rect x="280" y="88" width="400" height="52" rx="12" fill="#635bff"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="480" y="120" font-size="14.5" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffffff"&gt;Web 前端（incus-hub / 控制平面）&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;line x1="380" y1="140" x2="240" y2="188" stroke="#7a86a8" stroke-width="1.5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;line x1="580" y1="140" x2="720" y2="188" stroke="#7a86a8" stroke-width="1.5"/&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;rect x="64" y="188" width="380" height="220" rx="14" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#635bff" stroke-width="1.8"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="88" y="218" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#635bff"&gt;集群 A · 网段 1&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="88" y="238" font-size="11.5" fill="#7a86a8" font-family="Consolas,monospace"&gt;192.168.10.0/24&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="88" y="252" width="150" height="58" rx="10" fill="#f7f7ff" stroke="#635bff" stroke-width="1.2"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="163" y="276" font-size="12.5" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;A1 主&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="163" y="296" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" fill="#635bff"&gt;voter · 持库&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="254" y="252" width="150" height="58" rx="10" fill="#f0faf5" stroke="#0f9d6e" stroke-width="1.2"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="329" y="276" font-size="12.5" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;A2 副&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="329" y="296" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" fill="#0f9d6e"&gt;standby · 不投票&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="88" y="322" width="316" height="34" rx="8" fill="#f1f3fa"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="246" y="344" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#4a5478"&gt;实例：web01 · db01 · vm01 …（location 标注所在成员）&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="88" y="388" font-size="11" fill="#7a86a8"&gt;dqlite / Raft · 只管自己集群内部&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;rect x="516" y="188" width="380" height="220" rx="14" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#00b8d9" stroke-width="1.8"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="540" y="218" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#00b8d9"&gt;集群 B · 网段 2&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="540" y="238" font-size="11.5" fill="#7a86a8" font-family="Consolas,monospace"&gt;192.168.20.0/24&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="540" y="252" width="150" height="58" rx="10" fill="#f0fbfd" stroke="#00b8d9" stroke-width="1.2"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="615" y="276" font-size="12.5" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;B1 主&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="615" y="296" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" fill="#00b8d9"&gt;voter · 持库&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="706" y="252" width="150" height="58" rx="10" fill="#f0faf5" stroke="#0f9d6e" stroke-width="1.2"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="781" y="276" font-size="12.5" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;B2 副&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="781" y="296" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" fill="#0f9d6e"&gt;standby · 不投票&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="540" y="322" width="316" height="34" rx="8" fill="#f1f3fa"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="698" y="344" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#4a5478"&gt;实例：cache01 · ci01 …&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="540" y="388" font-size="11" fill="#7a86a8"&gt;dqlite / Raft · 只管自己集群内部&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;line x1="444" y1="300" x2="516" y2="300" stroke="#e8890c" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7,5"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="480" y="288" font-size="11.5" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e8890c"&gt;跨集群迁移&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="480" y="326" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="#7a86a8"&gt;copy + delete&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&#10; &#10; &lt;rect x="64" y="432" width="380" height="96" rx="12" fill="#f1f3fa"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="84" y="458" font-size="12.5" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;两个集群之间：零共享&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="84" y="480" font-size="11.5" fill="#4a5478"&gt;profile / 网络 / 存储池定义互不相通，&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="84" y="499" font-size="11.5" fill="#4a5478"&gt;OVN 逻辑交换机也不互通 —— 迁移要显式适配&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;rect x="516" y="432" width="380" height="96" rx="12" fill="#f6fbf9"/&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="536" y="458" font-size="12.5" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1f36"&gt;每个集群内部：1 主 + N 副&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="536" y="480" font-size="11.5" fill="#4a5478"&gt;副死无感；主死只影响该集群，另一个集群照常 ——&lt;/text&gt;&#10; &lt;text x="536" y="499" font-size="11.5" fill="#4a5478"&gt;故障域天然隔离在集群这一层&lt;/text&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Three layers: a single web frontend at the top (incus-hub / the control plane); below it two clusters sharing nothing — cluster A on subnet 1 (192.168.10.0/24, leader A1 + replica A2) and cluster B on subnet 2 (192.168.20.0/24, leader B1 + replica B2), each internally shaped like the &amp;ldquo;1 leader + N replicas&amp;rdquo; from earlier posts. The orange dashed line is cross-cluster migration: copy + delete in essence, with an IP change guaranteed. There is no shared database between the clusters; profiles, networks, and pool definitions are disconnected — that fact creates every difficulty below.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>